# thoth benchmarks (0.53.3): the hot paths the P(-1) audit measured, on the real src/ code, with no network and no terminal.
#
# Run: ./scripts/bench-history.sh   (appends bench-history.csv, rewrites benchmarks.md)
#  or: cyrius bench tests/thoth.bcyr
#
# Pattern: bench_new -> bench_batch_start -> loop -> bench_batch_stop -> bench_report. The heap never frees, so each row's count
# is what it can afford: a row that allocates per call says what that call costs.
include "src/vendor/bote-core.cyr"
